- [X] I am running the latest [kubo version](https://dist.ipfs.tech/#kubo) or have an issue updating.

### Installation method

ipfs-desktop

### Version

```Text
Kubo version: 0.19.0
Repo version: 13
System version: amd64/linux
Golang version: go1.19.1
```


